{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/51lRjB61Vz1yTPvXVpuwyg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:11.718836+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/51lRjB61Vz1yTPvXVpuwyg","html":"<div><section><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/x2tb5ZqKtNUpQqYId1AMWNLTpKkRLPpJ1icK3AMj8yXRafyHibibw5aFNu96wiaWPXonwUrAkppNFdXpBdxSUMyDfw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7uPYV6UT5njIbs3Z408sSflBT6LKFW8WuX3yug96V3e7mU169sCAiaPJLMW9MKjDSqFMKQKAclYBXh5vQXkez2A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>中国科学院西安光机所</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2025“嫦娥奔月”夏令营邀请函</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名6月21日开放日的小伙伴</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>不要重复报名夏令营哦！</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7uPYV6UT5njIbs3Z408sSflBT6LKFW8WuX3yug96V3e7mU169sCAiaPJLMW9MKjDSqFMKQKAclYBXh5vQXkez2A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>中国科学院西安光机所“嫦娥奔月” 夏令营</span><strong><span>拟定于7月16-18日举办</span></strong><span>，活动期间将会给同学们</span><strong><span>安排餐饮、住宿以及精美文创</span></strong><span>。活动内容主要包括</span><strong><span>学术报告、研究室介绍、导师实验室交流参观、师兄师姐经验交流、成果展示环节等</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7uPYV6UT5njIbs3Z408sSflBT6LKFW8WuX3yug96V3e7mU169sCAiaPJLMW9MKjDSqFMKQKAclYBXh5vQXkez2A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>XIOPM</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.具有良好的专业基础，预计可获得所在高校推免资格。</span></p><p><span>2.光电信息、电子科学与技术、物理、计算机、人工智能、测控技术与仪器、材料科学与工程、电子信息科学与工程、机械等相关专业的本科三年级学生（2026年7月毕业）。</span></p><p><span>3.对我所科研事业具有强烈兴趣，有意向来我所深造学习。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7uPYV6UT5njIbs3Z408sSflBT6LKFW8WuX3yug96V3e7mU169sCAiaPJLMW9MKjDSqFMKQKAclYBXh5vQXkez2A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>XIOPM</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请方式</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>即日起至6月10日，登录中国科学院大学科教结合协同育人计划网站（http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/index.php/zh/），选择右侧“大学生夏令营计划报名”栏目，注册后进入申请系统，承办单位：“西安光学精密机械研究所”，夏令营：“嫦娥奔月夏令营”。按要求如实填写系统中的各项信息并提交。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7uPYV6UT5njIbs3Z408sSflBT6LKFW8WuX3yug96V3e7mU169sCAiaPJLMW9MKjDSqFMKQKAclYBXh5vQXkez2A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>XIOPM</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>三、报到及提交材料</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.夏令营申请表（报名系统生成，须本人签字）；</span></p><p><span>2.本科成绩单和专业排名证明，需加盖教务处或院系公章；</span></p><p><span>3.其它能证明本人科研潜力的材料（包括但不限于已发表论文，申请专利，出版物复印件、奖励证书复印件、英语六级证书等）；</span></p><p><span>4.成果展示PPT</span><span>(5分钟)。</span></p><p><span><span><span>5.夏令营安全责任书（</span><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/51lRjB61Vz1yTPvXVpuwyg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">夏令营活动安全责任书.docx</a></span></span><span>）</span></span></span></p><p><span>将以上材料按序封装，一式两份，现场提交</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7uPYV6UT5njIbs3Z408sSflBT6LKFW8WuX3yug96V3e7mU169sCAiaPJLMW9MKjDSqFMKQKAclYBXh5vQXkez2A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>XIOPM</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>四、其他事项</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.入选结果将于6月15日在报名系统查看，录取的学员在报名系统中的状态会变更为“已通过”，同时短信或电子邮件通知入选者。</span></p><p><span>2. 夏令营期间提供食宿，发放交通补贴（需提交来陕的单程火车票，具体报销规则另行通知）。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7uPYV6UT5njIbs3Z408sSflBT6LKFW8WuX3yug96V3e7mU169sCAiaPJLMW9MKjDSqFMKQKAclYBXh5vQXkez2A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>XIOPM</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>五、联系方式</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>西安光机所官网：www.opt.ac.cn</span></p><p><span>地址：西安市高新区新型工业园信息大道17号</span></p><p><span>联系人：曹老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：029-88497564</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/7uPYV6UT5njIbs3Z408sSflBT6LKFW8WuX3yug96V3e7mU169sCAiaPJLMW9MKjDSqFMKQKAclYBXh5vQXkez2A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>XIOPM</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><b><span>往期精彩</span></b></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/7uPYV6UT5njIbs3Z408sSflBT6LKFW8WHgWbdSVCUGLYcmIyFevkKv8Ml20iblfJQwvYsiaVrK6KckLZG4uTJ